  "name": "rhdh-package-impact",
  "description": "Classifies whether an npm package in an RHDH plugins monorepo (rhdh-plugins, community-plugins) reaches published plugin code (PLUGIN_PROD), plugin harnesses (PLUGIN_DEV), local runners packages/app|app-legacy|backend (RUNNER), or workspace root (WORKSPACE_DEV). Discovers packages from open Dependabot alerts, checks first_patched_version / PATCHED_EXCEPT_RUNNER, bumps workspace yarn.lock via yarn up -R (plus allowlisted ancestor bumps), formats CVE PR tables, and dismisses runner-only / plugin-dev-only / workspace-dev-only alerts when policy allows. Use for Dependabot impact, CVE workspace bumps, runner-only dismiss, or fullsend chore/<workspace>-cve-bumps PRs.",
